# graphify code graph
# graph.json, manifest.json and .graphify_root are committed so the team can
# query the graph; cache/ (version-pinned AST cache) and .graphify_analysis.json
# (transient per-run analysis) stay local to avoid diff churn.
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/.graphify_analysis.json
